      <span data-lang-block="en">Welcome aboard — here's your starter guide</span>
      <span data-lang-block="id">Selamat bergabung — ini panduan awal untuk kamu</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      <span data-lang-block="zh" class="show">這頁面告訴你可以先學什麼、平常主要在做什麼工作，還有一件最重要的事：請假的規定。</span>
      <span data-lang-block="en">This page covers what to learn first, what your main tasks will be, and one very important rule about taking leave.</span>
      <span data-lang-block="id">Halaman ini berisi hal-hal yang perlu dipelajari lebih dulu, tugas utama sehari-hari, dan satu aturan paling penting tentang izin tidak masuk kerja.</span>
    </p>
  </section>

