      <span data-lang-block="en">Most important rule</span>
      <span data-lang-block="id">Aturan paling penting</span>
    </div>
    <h2>
      <span data-lang-block="zh" class="show">沒辦法來上班，一定要「先」請假</span>
      <span data-lang-block="en">If you can't come to work, request leave first</span>
      <span data-lang-block="id">Jika tidak bisa masuk kerja, harus izin lebih dulu</span>
    </h2>
    <p>
      <span data-lang-block="zh" class="show">如果生病、有事、或任何原因不能來上班，請務必「事先」跟主管請假，不可以直接不到、也不可以事後才說。臨時狀況也要盡快用電話或訊息告知，不要等到上班時間才聯絡。</span>
      <span data-lang-block="en">If you're sick, have something come up, or for any reason cannot come to work, you must ask your supervisor for leave in advance. Never simply not show up, and never explain only after the fact. Even in a sudden situation, call or message as early as possible — don't wait until your shift has already started.</span>
      <span data-lang-block="id">Jika sakit, ada urusan, atau alasan apa pun sehingga tidak bisa masuk kerja, kamu wajib izin kepada atasan terlebih dahulu. Jangan langsung tidak masuk tanpa kabar, dan jangan baru menjelaskan setelahnya. Kalau situasinya mendadak, tetap hubungi lewat telepon atau pesan sesegera mungkin — jangan menunggu sampai jam kerja dimulai.</span>
    </p>
  </div>

